    <guid isPermaLink="false">6aed7cf0b4a4e20202f5b4f9</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 07:12:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【时间线】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开场白</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="51">00:51</a> 嘉宾介绍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="148">02:28</a> 师者初心:何为传道、授业、解惑</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">8:00</a> 当心师生关系慢慢滑向雇佣模式，初心如何偏移，</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="939">15:39</a> 多元视角:聊聊不同风格导师，读懂不一样的相处节奏</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> 科研之中，我们该如何建立平等开放的交流氛围</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1643">27:23</a> 沟通困境:面对迟迟未至的反馈，怎样从容沟通、减少猜测内耗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2250">37:30</a> 向外渴求他人认可，本质是寻找对自己的接纳</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2534">42:14</a> 信号模糊:导师一句“你可以”，缺少清晰指引时该如何自处</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2831">47:11</a> 真诚与坦诚，是师生沟通最有力的钥匙</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2973">49:33</a> 总结:安顿好内心，少一些拉扯内耗，方能从容相伴，稳步向前。</span></p>]]></description>
